    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Blame the AI: A Data-Center Lockout, an 8-Agent Audit of 290 Bugs, Automated Gryphons, and Tactical Chickens]]></title>
      <link>https://joshuacox.github.io/blog/2026/11/25/blame-the-ai-a-datacenter-lockout-290-bugs-automated-gryphons-and-tactical-chickens/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[Twenty-four hours of peak engineering drama: Axonwall v0.16.0 ships Lean Core and promptly earns a trip to the data center, triggering an 8-subagent forensic audit (290 verified bugs) and a 2,164-line kernel rollback safety net—while Glyphrig automates Chrome Web Store v2 releases, BokBot clears 166/166 gameplay tests, and DeployCoop merges a -336,354-line red diff.]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://joshuacox.github.io/blog/2026/11/25/blame-the-ai-a-datacenter-lockout-290-bugs-automated-gryphons-and-tactical-chickens/</guid>
    </item>
